BaseSettler_forwardToFactory
├── when the factory call succeeds
│   └── it should return actualRolled to the caller
├── when the cellar reverts with OverfillCeiling
│   └── it should bubble the selector unmodified
├── when the cellar reverts with UnderfillNotAllowed
│   └── it should bubble the selector unmodified
├── when the cellar reverts with ZeroRollover
│   └── it should bubble the selector unmodified
├── when the cellar reverts with SettlerMismatch
│   └── it should bubble the selector unmodified
└── when the cellar reverts with PremiumAlreadyFiredForFiller on phase 1
    └── it should bubble the selector unmodified
